    'miaa.ctx.facturation':         'I\'m **MIAA+**, your Commercial Expert at **{entreprise}**.\n\nI can help you with:\n✓ Creating OHADA-compliant invoices\n✓ Managing client follow-ups\n✓ Analyzing your revenue and margins\n✓ Optimizing payment terms\n\nWhat would you like to do?',
